367:   // `@grabmode`: grab-class from-orig brush (grab/kelvinlet). The WGSL emit
368:   // mirrors CoProxy<AccumOrigGrab> (accum_mode.h): the stage derives each vert's
369:   // stroke-start base from the displacement field (binding 25) and the write-back
370:   // does per-dab first-touch arbitration via the dab-stamp buffer (binding 23).
371:   // The C++ leg ignores it — the executor selects AccumOrigGrab at runtime.
372:   bool isGrabMode = false;
373:   // `@relaxation`: the kernel relaxes the surface rather than displacing it, so
374:   // it never contributes to the accumulated brush displacement (§2 invariant of
